  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the murky depths of the Flow Below, 'Jawbone' Jimmy scavenged for scraps amongst the rusted relics of the old world. He saw his flock torn apart by roaming gangs which hardened him with unwavering resolve to acquire 'DRIP' by any means necessary. The Gasser he carries is a reminder of lost friends and a future fueled by vengeance.",
    "class": "Gearhead Raider",
    "name": "Jawbone Jimmy",
    "personality": "Ruthless and resourceful, Jimmy's locked jaw is a permanent testament to a close call with a rival gang. He's a pragmatic survivor, always calculating the odds, and favors direct action over flowery words.",
